---
// Replicating Litmus7's "What we do" layout for SEVENINE Platform Features
// Aesthetic: Confident whitespace, italic serif accent headline, and editorial 4-column breakdown
---

<section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40 overflow-hidden" id="features" aria-label="Platform Features">
  <!-- Vertical dashed guide lines continuing the editorial grid -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex justify-between z-0">
    <div class="h-full w-px border-l border-dashed border-neutral-300/40 dark:border-white/10"></div>
    <div class="h-full w-px border-r border-dashed border-neutral-300/40 dark:border-white/10"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Subtle Minimalist Pune Vector Watermark in Background -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-end overflow-hidden opacity-10 dark:opacity-15 z-0 pr-4 sm:pr-8 lg:pr-16 select-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      viewBox="0 0 740 712"
      class="w-full max-w-[540px] lg:max-w-[660px] max-h-[75vh] h-auto text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <path
        d="M217 72 L231 73 L238 86 L271 85 L289 91 L294 116 L318 126 L337 134 L359 140 L368 125 L386 137 L375 148 L351 153 L347 196 L376 224 L381 246 L404 267 L438 301 L442 330 L468 352 L462 359 L466 387 L477 403 L503 407 L516 389 L527 395 L527 422 L554 410 L546 432 L547 448 L567 464 L599 462 L620 458 L623 464 L614 475 L632 487 L645 473 L652 475 L648 494 L666 511 L670 520 L653 527 L649 545 L649 566 L641 583 L628 586 L620 577 L615 568 L575 570 L574 546 L532 540 L512 535 L494 537 L475 531 L454 534 L430 527 L406 523 L393 524 L377 518 L343 518 L321 505 L289 500 L269 485 L241 484 L240 501 L248 511 L242 515 L241 536 L224 540 L215 531 L193 531 L177 539 L166 526 L183 510 L174 498 L160 510 L150 510 L150 497 L154 481 L106 476 L109 447 L92 439 L90 408 L91 374 L72 365 L72 348 L87 337 L91 313 L78 304 L98 268 L115 215 L132 211 L143 197 L129 180 L137 146 L161 143 L184 125 L186 93 L219 99 Z"
        fill="currentColor"
      />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 w-full z-10">
    <!-- Top Header Area -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:gap-8 max-w-5xl">
      <!-- Eyebrow -->
      <span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-normal text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">
        Platform features
      </span>

      <!-- Headline: Italic Serif Accent + Bold Sans-Serif -->
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5rem] tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.08]">
        <span
          class="font-normal italic tracking-[-0.01em]"
          style="
            font-family: 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1b90ff 0%, #157973 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
          "
        >
          Unifying
        </span>
        <span
          class="font-bold text-[#1f242e] dark:text-white"
          style="font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Poppins', sans-serif;"
        >
          Pune's Brilliance
        </span>
      </h2>

      <!-- Subtitle Narrative -->
      <p class="text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
        Think Stack Overflow & LinkedIn meets Reddit — purpose-built for IB & IGCSE students in Pune. Academic rigor, verified peer connections, and campus-wide collaboration.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial 4-Column Feature Grid -->
    <div class="mt-16 sm:mt-24 lg:mt-28 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 lg:gap-8 xl:gap-12">
      <!-- Column 1: Core Platform Vision -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h3
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#1f242e] dark:text-white leading-snug"
          style="font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Poppins', sans-serif;"
        >
          Stack Overflow & LinkedIn meets Reddit
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-[0.95rem] text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Built specifically for IB & IGCSE. No generic boards or noise — engineered around IA, EE, CAS, and TOK requirements from day one.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Peer Collaborators & Matchmaking -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h3
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#1f242e] dark:text-white leading-snug"
          style="font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Poppins', sans-serif;"
        >
          Find collaborators & co-founders
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-[0.95rem] text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Discover teammates, study partners, hackathon squadmates, and co-founders across Pune international schools via verified academic profiles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Wildest Academic Discussions -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h3
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#1f242e] dark:text-white leading-snug"
          style="font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Poppins', sans-serif;"
        >
          Discuss your wildest IA, EE & CAS ideas
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-[0.95rem] text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Brainstorm radical theories, get raw constructive feedback, and debate your wildest thoughts with ambitious students across Pune.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 4: Event & Sports Tracker -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h3
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#1f242e] dark:text-white leading-snug"
          style="font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Poppins', sans-serif;"
        >
          Track events, sports & webinars
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-[0.95rem] text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          One unified tracker across Pune to start inter-school networking, discover athletic tournaments, and supercharge your CAS and extracurriculars.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
